<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在同步收藏…</view><view wx:elif="{{error && !items.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">暂时无法加载</view><view>{{error}}</view><button class="secondary retry" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}，当前显示上次同步内容。</view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">还没有收藏</view><view>在专业详情页点击“收藏”，内容会出现在这里。</view></view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card saved"><view class="saved-main" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="open"><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.universityName}} · {{item.level}}</view></view><text class="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="remove">删除</text></view></block></view>
